# Byte-exact research artefacts, added 2026-10-15 with the USD brief handoff.
# `docs/research/handoff/usd/v1/HANDOFF_MANIFEST.json` records the sha256 of every generated
# brief, the local Research Library registry records the same hash for each of the same 25
# files, and `tests/research_handoff.test.js` compares the archive's members with the files on
# disk. `-text` disables line-ending conversion in both directions, so a checkout hands back the
# bytes the builder wrote and one hash keeps meaning the same thing on every machine. Scoped to
# this folder, which this commit introduces; no path that already ships is covered.
docs/research/handoff/** -text
docs/research/topics/** -text
docs/research/factors/** -text
docs/research/final/** -text
data/research-library/** -text
